	(text "I2S Bus (BCLK, LRCLK, RX, TX): Pins 18, 19, 20, 21 (Pin 20 is a GBIN, which is great if the Pico ever needs to send a master clock).\n"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 245.364 18.288 0)
		(effects
