	(text "DAC Data Bus (8 Pins): Pins 48, 47, 46, 45, 44, 4, 3, 2. (This routes the transmitting DAC entirely to the bottom edge of the board, isolating it from the ADC).\nDAC Clock OUT: Pin 6 (This is IOB_13b on Bank 1, which sits physically right next to the Bank 2 pins on the right side of the chip)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
